  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support for Beredskapslyftet 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Beredskapslyftet 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidraget syftar till att st&#xe4;rka barnsjukv&#xe5;rd i Ukraina, inklusive till det av Ryssland bombade barnsjukhuset Okhmatdyt i Kiev, genom leverans av medicinsk utrustning, generatorer och powerbatterier f&#xf6;r elf&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjning, samt genomf&#xf6;rande av utbildningar f&#xf6;r sjukv&#xe5;rdspersonal i avancerad intensivv&#xe5;rd. St&#xf6;det v&#xe4;ntas bidra till att s&#xe4;kra fungerande sjukv&#xe5;rd f&#xf6;r barn i en kritisk humanit&#xe4;r situation i Ukraina.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution aims to strengthen children&#x2019;s healthcare in Ukraine, including to the children&#x2019;s hospital Ohmatdyt in Kyiv, which was damaged in a Russian air strike, by provision of medical equipment, generators and power batteries for electricity supply, as well as training programmes for healthcare personnel in advanced intensive care. The project is expected to strengthen children&#x2019;s healthcare during a critical humanitarian situation in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
